whisper.cpp
------------------------------------------
Port of OpenAI's Whisper model in C/C++

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libSDL2_2.0_0-2.32.74-1
  libavcodec63-9.0.2-3
  libavformat63-9.0.2-3
  libavutil61-9.0.2-3
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libggml-devel-0.29.0-1bl3
  libggml0-0.29.0-1bl3
  libllama0-0.9.0-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libswresample7-9.0.2-3
  libwhisper-devel-1.9.5-1bl1
  libwhisper1-1.9.5-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libSDL2-devel-2.32.74-1
  libavcodec-devel-9.0.2-3
  libavformat-devel-9.0.2-3
  libavutil-devel-9.0.2-3
  libggml-devel-0.29.0-1bl3
  libllama-devel-0.9.0-1bl1
  libswresample-devel-9.0.2-3
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp/archive/refs/tags/v1.9.5.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack whisper.cpp-1.9.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./whisper.cpp-1.9.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/whisper.cpp-1.9.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/whisper.cpp-1.9.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwhisper1-1.9.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwhisper-devel-1.9.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(whisper.cpp)
  /usr/bin/parakeet-cli.exe
  /usr/bin/parakeet-quantize.exe
  /usr/bin/whisper-bench.exe
  /usr/bin/whisper-cli.exe
  /usr/bin/whisper-command.exe
  /usr/bin/whisper-lsp.exe
  /usr/bin/whisper-quantize.exe
  /usr/bin/whisper-server.exe
  /usr/bin/whisper-stream.exe
  /usr/bin/whisper-talk-llama.exe
  /usr/bin/whisper-vad-speech-segments.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/whisper.cpp.README
  /usr/share/doc/whisper.cpp/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/whisper.cpp/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/whisper.cpp/README.md

(libwhisper1)
  /usr/bin/cygparakeet-1.dll
  /usr/bin/cygwhisper-1.dll

(libwhisper-devel)
  /usr/include/parakeet.h
  /usr/include/whisper.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/parakeet/parakeet-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/parakeet/parakeet-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/whisper/whisper-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/whisper/whisper-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/libparakeet.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libwhisper.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/parakeet.pc
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/whisper.pc

